%% Connection lifecycle (protocol v3). USB: plain TCP on 127.0.0.1:8765 via adb reverse, no proof.
%% Wi-Fi: TLS on mac-ip:8766 with the Mac's self-signed certificate, pinned by the tablet.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant T as Tablet (InkBridgeClient)
  participant H as Mac (PeerConnection)

  Note over T,H: Discovery: Bonjour _inkbridge._tcp, TXT id=host_id (Wi-Fi only)
  T->>H: TCP connect · Wi-Fi: TLS handshake (tablet pins SHA-256 of the certificate if paired)
  H->>T: auth.challenge {nonce, required (false on USB), host_id}
  alt Wi-Fi, first contact (Connect Device open on the Mac)
    T->>H: device.hello {…, auth_mode: pair, auth = HMAC(code, "…pair"‖0‖nonce‖fp_seen)}
    alt code valid, window open, fp matches the Mac's own
      H->>T: pair.granted {host_id, host_name, token, proof = HMAC(code, "…host"‖0‖nonce‖fp)}
      Note over T: verify proof → store token + pin + host_id
      Note over H: ticket closed (single use)
    else wrong code / MITM fingerprint / window closed
      H->>T: error {auth_failed | pairing_closed}
      H--xT: close · 5 wrong codes void the ticket
      Note over T: ClientState.Failed (no retry loop)
    end
  else Wi-Fi, paired
    Note over T: host_id must match the stored one, else no proof is sent
    T->>H: device.hello {…, auth_mode: token, auth = HMAC(token, "…token"‖0‖nonce‖fp)}
    alt unknown device
      H->>T: error {not_paired} · tablet clears its pairing
    end
  else USB
    T->>H: device.hello {…}
  end
  H->>T: device.ready {host_name, session_id, host_id, resume_sequence}
  Note over T: re-send document messages with seq > resume_sequence<br/>(same host + session only), then canvas.viewport

  par every 2 s, both directions
    H->>T: connection.ping
    T->>H: connection.pong
  end
  loop drawing
    T->>H: stroke.begin / stroke.point / stroke.end (ordered, sequenced)
  end

  Note over T,H: 7 s silence ⇒ close. Client retries 250 → 2000 ms (±20 %),<br/>and immediately on Android network-available (measured 163 ms to ready).<br/>Mac re-registers its listener after wake / path change.
